\paragraph{Audit corrections.} Dependency completeness and origin identity are separate requirements. The minimality claim is restricted to a fixed graph of mandatory edges; no general minimum workbook problem is silently solved.
\paragraph{External computation.} None; symbolic arguments and boundary checks only.
